  "title": "Hertz Announces Pricing of Offering of 37,037,037 Shares of Common Stock",
  "summary": "Hertz Global Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: HTZ) (“Hertz” or the “Company”), a leading global rental car company, today announced that it has priced a SEC-registered offering of 37,037,037 shares of its common stock, par value $0.01 per share, (the “Common Stock”), at a public offering price of $2.70 per share.",
